flowchart TD
  END[Activity end or Cap revoke] --> REV[reverse lineage]
  REV --> R{receipt present?}
  R -->|yes| SET[prefer landed set]
  R -->|no| SET2[use authorized set]
  SET --> PLAN{reverse class}
  SET2 --> PLAN
  PLAN -->|inverse| INV[inverse Ops]
  PLAN -->|compensation| RC[Intents under recovery Cap]
  PLAN -->|none| MARK[non-reversible mark + audit]
  INV -->|fail| MARK
  RC -->|fail| MARK
  INV -->|ok| OK[clean reverse]
  RC -->|ok| OK
